{"ref":"BDB, עָדַר","hw":"עָדַר","html":"† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עָדַר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> prob. (si vera l.) <strong>help (</strong>Aramaic loan-word, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܥܕܰܪ</span>, 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדַר</span> (rare) = Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">עזר</span> q.v.; > Thes, assuming meaning <em>arrange, order</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַעֲדֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.34\">1 Ch 12:34</a> (Baer Ginsb; van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.33\">33</a>; this meaning also 𝔊 𝔙); but < Codd. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַעֲוֹר</span> (cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.23\">23</a>. van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.22\">22</a>), so Kau Buhl; Pt. pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹדְרֵי מַעֲרָכָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.39\">39</a> (van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.38\">38</a>), read <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹרְכֵי</span> (q.v. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.34\">34</a>) 𝔊 Kau; see <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עָרַךְ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עָרַךְ\">ערך</a>.","next":"BDB, עַדְרִיאֵל","prev":"BDB, עָדַף"}